  "description": "GroupDocs.Total for .NET is a compilation of every .NET API offered by GroupDocs. We compile it on a regular basis to ensure that it contains the most up to date versions of each of our .NET document manipulation APIs.\n\n      With GroupDocs.Total for .NET developers can use all our APIs with a single license. However, you can order any individual API as well. The APIs we offer include:\n\n      * GroupDocs.Annotation for .NET - 24.12\n      * GroupDocs.Assembly for .NET - 24.12\n      * GroupDocs.Comparison for .NET - 25.2\n\t  * GroupDocs.Conversion for .NET - 25.2.1\n\t  * GroupDocs.Editor for .NET - 24.12\n\t  * GroupDocs.Merger for .NET - 25.2.1\n\t  * GroupDocs.Metadata for .NET - 25.2\n\t  * GroupDocs.Parser for .NET - 25.2\n\t  * GroupDocs.Redaction for .NET - 24.10\n\t  * GroupDocs.Search for .NET - 25.2\n\t  * GroupDocs.Signature for .NET - 25.1\n\t  * GroupDocs.Viewer for .NET - 25.2\n\t  * GroupDocs.Watermark for .NET - 25.2\n\n      GroupDocs.Total for .NET Documentation\n      https://docs.groupdocs.com/total/net\n\n      Free support for GroupDocs.Total for .NET is provided on our support forum:\n      https://forum.groupdocs.com",
